    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d854">

                <pb facs="1190" n="1698" sameAs="frus:frus1948v05p2/pg1698"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BB Palestine/12–2948: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Special Representative of the United States in
                        Israel</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">McDonald</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Acting Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tel Aviv</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-12-29T16:00:00+02:00">December 29,
                            1948—4 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>349. Acceptance by S.C. of Beeley resolution<anchor n="1" xml:id="d854-f1"/>
                    would, we believe, postpone peace in Negev by encouraging Egypt’s continued
                    refusal negotiate armistice. Moreover, PGI cannot surrender military gains in
                    Negev especially since Egypt shows no willingness recognize Israel’s existence,
                    MG [<hi rendition="#italic">sic</hi>] state or to deal with PGI.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McDonald</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d854-f1" n="1" xml:id="d854-f1-content">
                <p>See resolution of December 29, <hi rendition="#italic">infra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
